{
  "uid": "codexlb-pipeline-health",
  "title": "codexlb2otel: Pipeline health",
  "description": "Ingest lag, decode health, and sink delivery health from issue #8's self-observability metrics. One panel (archive drift findings, issue #13) is still a genuine forward reference - see its own description.",
  "tags": [
    "codexlb2otel",
    "codex-lb",
    "pipeline-health"
  ],
  "timezone": "utc",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "service_name",
        "label": "Service",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "grafanacloud-prom"
        },
        "query": "label_values(codexlb_responses_total, service_name)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "multi": false,
        "includeAll": false,
        "regex": "",
        "current": {
          "selected": false,
          "text": "",
          "value": ""
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Status",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 6
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Issue #8's self-observability metrics landed in this repo's working tree (uncommitted, a concurrent lane) while this dashboard was being built, so every panel below is wired against the REAL metric names in `internal/attr/names.go`'s \"Self-observability metrics\" block and `internal/sink/otlpmetric/selfobs.go` - not the placeholders an earlier draft used. These are ObservableGauge/ObservableCounter instruments (callback-driven, one `selfobs.Snapshot` per collection tick, none carry `gen_ai.*` base attributes - selfobs.go's own doc comment on why). **`codexlb_archive_drift_findings` (issue #13) is still a genuine forward reference** - confirmed absent from both files as of this dashboard's authoring; see the drift panel below and `dashboards/alerts/drift-breaking.yaml`. **Caveat: issue #8's code was uncommitted and actively changing during this task** - reconfirm against internal/attr/names.go before trusting these names long-term, the same way every other panel on these dashboards was built against code rather than issue prose."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Ingest lag - the alert that catches everything else",
      "description": "codexlb.selfobs.ingest_lag_seconds, ObservableGauge, unit s (name already ends in _seconds so the Prometheus translator does not double it - verified against opentelemetry-collector-contrib's own suffix-dedup behavior). Wall-clock now minus the newest record timestamp the watcher has seen; a stopped watcher, a stuck checkpoint or a sink swallowing everything all show up here first.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max",
            "last"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "grafanacloud-prom"
          },
          "expr": "codexlb_selfobs_ingest_lag_seconds{service_name=~\"$service_name\"}",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "**NOT YET IMPLEMENTED** (issue #8/#13 - concurrent lane). Archive drift findings, by severity",
      "description": "**NOT YET IMPLEMENTED** (issue #8/#13 - concurrent lane). issue #13: breaking should page, new should notify, info (absence findings) must never page. Confirmed absent from internal/attr/names.go and internal/sink/otlpmetric as of this dashboard's authoring - a genuine gap, not superseded by issue #8's landing.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
